== event 1: channel 65, author 1562594665109393468 (bot): <@1000> explain AI usage
POST /channels/65/messages (multipart)
{"content":"**Wimsy for bots and AI agents** (the full guide is attached: wimsy-ai-usage.md)\n- Address me with a real mention `<@1000>` or a Discord reply to my message. Only allowlisted bots are served; others and webhooks are ignored. Limits per bot: 3 requests at once, then 6/min (one `rate limited: retry in N s` notice, then silence); at most 5 replies in a row to me without a human message.\n- Recommended: one code block tagged json holding a JSON frontend request (as `ucas --json`), or an array of up to 8:\n```json\n{\"id\": 1, \"cmd\": \"integrate\", \"args\": {\"f\": \"x^2 sin(x)\"}}\n```\n  Code: `{\"cmd\": \"spirv_simplify\", \"args\": {\"code\": \"<GLSL, SPIR-V asm or C>\"}}`. Shader on images: `{\"cmd\": \"animate\", \"args\": {\"code\": \"<GLSL>\", \"inputs\": [\"black\", {\"attachment\": 1}]}}` with the image attached.\n- Reply: a json code block `{\"id\", \"ok\", \"cmd\", \"result\", \"notes\", \"checks\", \"files\", \"text\", \"error\"}`; files are attached and listed by name. Too long: the whole response is attached as response.json and `\"full\": \"response.json\"` says so. `{\"cmd\": \"schema\"}` attaches schema.json (every command).\n- Ambiguity: `ok` false, `error.code` \"ambiguous\" with `error.key` and `error.readings`; repeat with `\"assume\": {\"KEY\": INDEX}` or `\"defaults\": true` in args. Never a question.\n- Text also works: English or ucas, one statement per line, code in code blocks tagged glsl, spv or c, or attached, images as shader inputs in order. A numbered question: reply to it with the number.\n- Reactions: ❓ question, ✅ answered, ❌ failed. State persists per channel (`reset` clears it). 2 s CPU / 60 s per request; no host files, no network.\n- Don't loop: never answer my replies automatically, wait out rate limits, keep requests self-contained.\n","embeds":[],"allowed_mentions":{"parse":[],"roles":[],"users":[],"replied_user":false},"message_reference":{"message_id":"7401","channel_id":"65","guild_id":"7","fail_if_not_exists":false},"attachments":[{"id":"0","filename":"wimsy-ai-usage.md","description":"","content_type":"text/markdown; charset=utf-8","size":5380,"url":"","proxy_url":"","ephemeral":false}]}
  files[0]: wimsy-ai-usage.md, text/markdown; charset=utf-8, 5380 bytes
PUT /channels/65/messages/7401/reactions/check/@me

